  "sourceTitle": "Herbs Seasoning Blend",
  "sourceText": "Herbs Seasoning Blend\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, December 14, 2009 - 12:27am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon Dried Thyme\n1 tablespoon Dried Oregano\n2 teaspoons Sage\n1 teaspoon Dried Rosemary\n1 teaspoon Dried Marjoram\n1 teaspoon Dried Basil\n1 teaspoon Dried Parsley\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients; store in an airtight container. Use in omelets and to season fish, vegetables, or chicken. 2 NOTES : 3 Yield: 1/4 cup",
